  "https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-connector#modellingNote" : [ {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "PackagingMaterial is aligned as a subclass of dpp:MaterialOfComposition. The textile-specific type property remains separate because its range is a SKOS controlled concept, while dpp:hasMaterialType ranges over an OWL class."
